*KEYWORD
*TITLE
spot weld coupon, load angle 30 deg, DP600 t=1.5 mm, nugget 5 mm
$ units: mm / ms / kg / kN / GPa
$ pull direction (0.866, 0, 0.500) - 30 deg from pure shear
$ take the peak resultant from the swforc file; that is one point
$ on the weld failure envelope fitted by calibrate.py
$ failure is left OFF in these decks (NRR/NRS blank) so the peak
$ load is governed by the sheet, not by an assumed weld strength
